/E (The system can be further enhanced by incorporating real-time sales data and advanced machine learning models such as Random Forest, XGBoost, and Gradient Boosting for improved demand forecasting. Future development can include a real-time prediction API and an interactive dashboard to visualize sales trends and predicted demand. Model monitoring and automatic retraining can also be implemented to adapt to changing demand patterns. The system can eventually be extended to provide automated inventory and stock-replenishment recommendations based on predicted demand.)
